# ── Minecraft ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# Game traffic (25565 Java, 19132 Bedrock) bypasses Cloudflare — the VPS
# publishes those ports directly (see services/minecraft/docker-compose.yml),
# so client traffic reaches the JVM without going through this vhost. This
# vhost is just a human-readable landing page for the HTTPS hostname so
# anyone hitting https://mc.jehpok.com in a browser gets connect info
# instead of a 404.
https://mc.jehpok.com {
    import tls_keys
    header {
        Strict-Transport-Security "max-age=31536000"
        X-Content-Type-Options "nosniff"
    }
    @root path /
    respond @root `ok


Server IP: 137.74.166.131
Java:     mc.jehpok.com:25565  (Paper, latest stable)
Bedrock:  mc.jehpok.com:19132  (Geyser + Floodgate, TCP+UDP)


Dashboard (Tailscale-only): https://server.jehpok.com/mc
`
    respond "not found" 404
}

# ── Vaultwarden (password manager) ─────────────────────────────────────────

